        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Hwan-kyung, Guiyeoni, Im Soo-jung\n- Works: He Was Cool, Lump Sugar, That Guy was Cool\n- Topics: South Korean films, Internet novels, film debut, film direction, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, Guiyeoni wrote the Internet novel That Guy was Cool.\n- In 2004, He Was Cool was released as a South Korean film based on Guiyeoni's 2001 Internet novel That Guy was Cool.\n- In 2004, Lee Hwan-kyung debuted with He Was Cool.\n- In 2006, Lee Hwan-kyung directed the South Korean film Lump Sugar.\n- In 2006, Im Soo-jung starred in the South Korean film Lump Sugar.",
